{"seq":2,"slug":"multiwindow-burnrate","title":"多窗口多燃烧率告警规则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/alerting-engineering/slo-burn-rate/multiwindow-burnrate","wordCount":2695,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"多窗口多燃烧率告警规则\">多窗口多燃烧率告警规则</h1><p>有了 SLI 和 SLO，剩下的问题是：什么时候叫醒人。最朴素的做法是「SLI 低于 SLO 就报警」，它有两个致命缺点——检测太慢（要等一整个 28 天窗口的比率掉下来），以及一旦触发就再也停不下来（因为窗口是滚动的，历史损失会持续压制当前比率）。燃烧率方法同时解决这两个问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-燃烧率与-耗尽时间\">核心概念：燃烧率与「耗尽时间」</h2><p>燃烧率（burn rate）的定义是<strong>当前错误率相对于 SLO 允许错误率的倍数</strong>。设 SLO 为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>（例如 0.999），允许的错误比例为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>（例如 0.001）。若当前测量窗口内实际错误比例为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>，则：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>BR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>e</mi><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{BR} = \\frac{e}{1 - S}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8769em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>几个直接推论：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>BR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{BR} = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示按当前速度，误差预算刚好会在 SLO 窗口结束时用尽。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>BR</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{BR} &gt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 表示预算正在被超额消耗。</li>\n<li>燃烧率与「耗尽时间」是一一对应的：如果误差预算为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B = 1-S</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span></span></span></span></span>（占窗口的比例），当前以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>BR</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{BR}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BR</span></span></span></span></span></span> 倍速度消耗，则剩余时间占窗口的比例为：</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>exhaust</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>B</mi><mtext>BR</mtext></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>W</mi><mtext>BR</mtext></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{exhaust}} = \\frac{B}{\\text{BR}} \\times W = \\frac{W}{\\text{BR}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">exhaust</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BR</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BR</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">W</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>最后这个等价关系极其有用：<strong><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>BR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>14.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{BR} = 14.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14.4</span></span></span></span></span> 与「28 小时耗尽」是同一句话</strong>。15 分钟量级的燃烧率告警带的是这个直觉——1 小时窗口上烧 14.4 倍，意味着如果持续下去，一整月（28 天）的预算会在约 1.94 天内烧完。这是「必须马上看」的量级。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[SLI 时间序列] --&gt; B[选窗口&lt;br/&gt;1h / 6h / 3d]&#10;    B --&gt; C[计算窗口内错误比例 e]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;BR = e / (1-S)&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E{BR 超过阈值?}&#10;    E --&gt;|否| F[不触发]&#10;    E --&gt;|是| G{长窗口也&lt;br/&gt;超过阈值?}&#10;    G --&gt;|否| H[抑制&lt;br/&gt;疑似瞬时抖动]&#10;    G --&gt;|是| I[触发&lt;br/&gt;确定分级]&#10;    I --&gt; J[路由到对应渠道]\">graph TD\n    A[SLI 时间序列] --&gt; B[选窗口&lt;br/&gt;1h / 6h / 3d]\n    B --&gt; C[计算窗口内错误比例 e]\n    C --&gt; D[\"BR = e / (1-S)\"]\n    D --&gt; E{BR 超过阈值?}\n    E --&gt;|否| F[不触发]\n    E --&gt;|是| G{长窗口也&lt;br/&gt;超过阈值?}\n    G --&gt;|否| H[抑制&lt;br/&gt;疑似瞬时抖动]\n    G --&gt;|是| I[触发&lt;br/&gt;确定分级]\n    I --&gt; J[路由到对应渠道]</pre><h2 id=\"为什么需要两个窗口同时满足\">为什么需要两个窗口同时满足</h2><p>单窗口燃烧率规则面临一个两难：窗口短则检测快但抖动多，窗口长则稳定但响应慢。多窗口方法用「短窗口检测、长窗口确认」的与门（AND gate）同时拿到两者的好处。</p>\n<p>机制是这样的：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>短窗口</strong>（例如 5 分钟或 1 小时）负责<strong>快速发现</strong>。它对新发生的故障反应快，但单独的短窗口在低流量或低错误率下统计噪声大——一个窗口里出现几个错误就可能把燃烧率推高数倍。</li>\n<li><strong>长窗口</strong>（例如 1 小时或 6 小时）负责<strong>确认持续性</strong>。它要求故障有足够的时间纵深，把「瞬时抖动」和「持续退化」区分开。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>两个窗口的阈值通常取同一个，或长窗口略低。规则形式为：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"短窗口 BR &gt; T  AND  长窗口 BR &gt; T  →  触发\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>短窗口 BR > T  AND  长窗口 BR > T  →  触发</span></span></code></pre></div><p>举个例子，28 天 SLO 窗口下，想在任何 1 小时窗口内烧掉 2% 的误差预算就被告知。推导是一条乘法：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>BR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mtext>目标预算消耗比例</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>SLO 窗口</mtext></mrow><mtext>告警窗口</mtext></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.02</mn><mo>×</mo><mfrac><mn>720</mn><mn>1</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>14.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{BR} = \\frac{\\text{目标预算消耗比例} \\times \\text{SLO 窗口}}{\\text{告警窗口}} = 0.02 \\times \\frac{720}{1} = 14.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0463em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">告警窗口</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">目标预算消耗比例</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SLO </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">窗口</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.02</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">720</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14.4</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这里分子 720 小时取的是 30 天（Google SRE Workbook 表格的取法，与 28 天的差别约 3%，不影响量级）。同样的形式给出另外两档：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.05</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>720</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>6</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.05 \\times 720 / 6 = 6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">720/6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0.10</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>720</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>72</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0.10 \\times 720 / 72 = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.10</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">720/72</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。<strong>记住这条乘法比记住三个数字有用</strong>——它让你在 SLO 窗口或告警窗口变化时能自己重算，而不必猜测表格里的数字从哪来。</p>\n<p>需要区分两个容易混淆的概念：<strong>「预算消耗比例」是这条规则想抓住的严重程度</strong>（2% 预算在 1 小时内烧掉，是一件必须立刻处理的事），<strong>「燃烧率」是它的数学表达</strong>。上表中「预算消耗」列是设计意图，「阈值」列是配置参数，后者由前者与窗口共同决定。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>严重度</th>\n<th>长窗口</th>\n<th>短窗口</th>\n<th>长窗口阈值</th>\n<th>短窗口阈值</th>\n<th>预算消耗</th>\n<th>对应耗尽时间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>紧急（Page）</td>\n<td>1 小时</td>\n<td>5 分钟</td>\n<td>14.4</td>\n<td>14.4</td>\n<td>~2%</td>\n<td>约 2 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>紧急（Page）</td>\n<td>6 小时</td>\n<td>30 分钟</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>6</td>\n<td>~5%</td>\n<td>约 4.7 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>工单（Ticket）</td>\n<td>3 天</td>\n<td>6 小时</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>~10%</td>\n<td>约 28 天</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的读法是：<strong>每一行对应一种「预算在以需要关注的速度被消耗」的情形，且长窗口确认了它的持续性</strong>。三行同时存在，覆盖了从急性（分钟级故障）到慢性（持续轻微退化）的整个谱。这是多窗口方法最核心的价值：<strong>用一组规则覆盖了传统方法需要无数条阈值规则才能近似覆盖的范围</strong>。</p>\n<p>关于「为什么短窗口也必须满足阈值」有一个常见误解需要澄清：短窗口的作用是<strong>快速</strong>，长窗口的作用是<strong>确认</strong>。如果只要求长窗口满足，检测延迟会接近长窗口长度（6 小时才报警，太慢）；如果只要求短窗口满足，误报会多到不可用。同时要求两者，等价于「最近很短的时间内确实在烧，且过去较长一段时间内也在烧」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"落地实现-记录规则与表达式\">落地实现：记录规则与表达式</h2><p>直接在告警规则里写多窗口聚合会导致每次评估都重新计算长窗口（例如 3 天）的全量数据，成本高且容易超时。标准做法是用<strong>记录规则</strong>（recording rules）预先计算各窗口的错误比例，告警规则只做阈值比较。Prometheus 生态的形态如下（示意，非完整配置）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"groups:&#10;  - name: slo-search&#10;    interval: 30s&#10;    rules:&#10;      - record: search:sli_errors:ratio5m&#10;        expr: |&#10;          sum(rate(search_requests_total{code=~&quot;5..&quot;}[5m]))&#10;          /&#10;          sum(rate(search_requests_total[5m]))&#10;      - record: search:sli_errors:ratio1h&#10;        expr: |&#10;          sum(rate(search_requests_total{code=~&quot;5..&quot;}[1h]))&#10;          /&#10;          sum(rate(search_requests_total[1h]))&#10;      - record: search:sli_errors:ratio6h&#10;        expr: |&#10;          sum(rate(search_requests_total{code=~&quot;5..&quot;}[6h]))&#10;          /&#10;          sum(rate(search_requests_total[6h]))&#10;      - record: search:sli_errors:ratio3d&#10;        expr: |&#10;          sum(rate(search_requests_total{code=~&quot;5..&quot;}[3d]))&#10;          /&#10;          sum(rate(search_requests_total[3d]))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">groups</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">slo-search</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    interval</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">30s</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    rules</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">search:sli_errors:ratio5m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          sum(rate(search_requests_total{code=~\"5..\"}[5m]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          sum(rate(search_requests_total[5m]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">search:sli_errors:ratio1h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          sum(rate(search_requests_total{code=~\"5..\"}[1h]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          sum(rate(search_requests_total[1h]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">search:sli_errors:ratio6h</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          sum(rate(search_requests_total{code=~\"5..\"}[6h]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          sum(rate(search_requests_total[6h]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">record</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">search:sli_errors:ratio3d</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          sum(rate(search_requests_total{code=~\"5..\"}[3d]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          /</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          sum(rate(search_requests_total[3d]))</span></span></code></pre></div><p>告警规则用预计算的比率构造燃烧率与与门：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- alert: SearchErrorBudgetBurnFast&#10;  expr: |&#10;    (search:sli_errors:ratio5m  / (1 - 0.999) &gt; 14.4)&#10;    and&#10;    (search:sli_errors:ratio1h  / (1 - 0.999) &gt; 14.4)&#10;  for: 2m&#10;  labels:&#10;    severity: page\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">alert</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SearchErrorBudgetBurnFast</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  expr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    (search:sli_errors:ratio5m  / (1 - 0.999) > 14.4)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    and</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    (search:sli_errors:ratio1h  / (1 - 0.999) > 14.4)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">2m</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  labels</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    severity</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">page</span></span></code></pre></div><p>三个实现细节值得记录。</p>\n<p><strong>细节一：<code>for: 2m</code> 与短窗口长度要匹配。</strong> 短窗口是 5 分钟，如果 <code>for</code> 设成 5 分钟，总检测延迟会变成「故障发生后 5 分钟窗口填满 + 2 分钟确认」，比预期慢。通常短窗口已经提供了平滑，<code>for</code> 只需覆盖一两次评估的抖动（2 分钟或直接 0）。反过来，如果短窗口取 1 分钟，<code>for</code> 需要更长以补偿统计噪声。</p>\n<p><strong>细节二：低流量时比率会失真。</strong> 如果某分群在某小时只有 10 个请求，出现 1 个错误就是 10% 的错误率，燃烧率会爆表。处理方式有两种：给告警表达式加最小请求量条件（<code>and sum(rate(...[1h])) &gt; 100</code>，单位是每秒请求数），或对低流量分群改用绝对错误数阈值。<strong>不要</strong>用「取更长的窗口」来规避，那会同时拖慢检测。</p>\n<p><strong>细节三：<code>rate</code> 函数对指标重置的处理。</strong> 计数器重置（进程重启、Pod 重建）会让 <code>rate</code> 产生虚假尖峰。Prometheus 的 <code>rate</code> 会自动补偿单次重置，但频繁重启的场景下仍可能失真。这是一个容易忽略的交互：如果被监控服务每小时重启一次（例如有内存泄漏的定期重启策略），燃烧率告警会在每次重启时误报一次，而这类误报会被误判为「负载波动」而长期不修。识别方法是核对误报时刻与重启记录的吻合度，这个核对动作属于 <a href=\"../oncall-practice/alert-review\">告警质量周会与持续调参</a> 的标准流程。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与单阈值告警的取舍\">与单阈值告警的取舍</h2><p>多窗口燃烧率不是无代价的。理解代价才能判断什么时候不该用它。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>静态阈值</th>\n<th>单窗口燃烧率</th>\n<th>多窗口燃烧率</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>规则数量（覆盖同等范围）</td>\n<td>多（每种故障模式几条）</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>少（2-3 条覆盖全谱）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>检测延迟</td>\n<td>取决于 <code>for</code> 与阈值</td>\n<td>短窗口长度</td>\n<td>短窗口长度 + 评估间隔</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>误报率</td>\n<td>高（阈值漂移）</td>\n<td>中（抖动）</td>\n<td>低（长短与门）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定位能力</td>\n<td>强（规则本身指向具体指标）</td>\n<td>弱（只说「在烧」）</td>\n<td>弱</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>前置条件</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>需要 SLI/SLO</td>\n<td>需要 SLI/SLO + 记录规则基础设施</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对业务变化的适应性</td>\n<td>差</td>\n<td>好（阈值自动跟随）</td>\n<td>好</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最后一列揭示了关键取舍：<strong>燃烧率告警的定位能力很弱</strong>。它告诉你「搜索结果的错误预算在快速消耗」，但不告诉你为什么。这不是缺陷，而是分工——燃烧率告警负责决定「要不要叫人」，定位由随告警一起送达的诊断上下文（看板、追踪、最近变更）负责，这也正是 <a href=\"../alerting-fundamentals/symptom-vs-cause\">症状告警与原因告警</a> 中「症状层主要告警 + 诊断信息随行」的具体实现。</p>\n<p>因此正确的组合是分层而不是替代：少量燃烧率规则作为「主要告警」决定是否叫人，少量静态阈值规则覆盖那些燃烧率抓不到的东西（容量外推、证书过期、副本数），其余指标全进看板。一个健康的搜索服务通常在 5 到 10 条告警规则左右，而不是上百条。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见配置错误\">常见配置错误</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误</th>\n<th>后果</th>\n<th>修正</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>短窗口比长窗口还长</td>\n<td>与门失去意义，长窗口恒满足</td>\n<td>短窗口严格短于长窗口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>长短窗口阈值设成不同但未说明理由</td>\n<td>后期调参时改错</td>\n<td>阈值要么相同，要么在注释里写明推导</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用自然月做 SLO 窗口</td>\n<td>每月预算天数不同，燃烧率基准漂移</td>\n<td>统一用滚动 28 天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>忘记低流量保护</td>\n<td>小分群频繁误报</td>\n<td>加最小请求量条件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只配紧急级别</td>\n<td>慢性轻微退化无人处理</td>\n<td>同时配工单级别的慢燃烧规则</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>窗口过长（例如 30 天）</td>\n<td>检测延迟以天计</td>\n<td>最长用 3 天，且只配工单级别</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第四条在实践中造成的噪声最多。一个小分群（例如某个新上线地区的搜索流量）可能只占总量的 0.5%，绝对请求量在分钟级别只有个位数，此时比例型指标完全不可用。识别方法是：<strong>计算每个分群在最短告警窗口内的期望请求数</strong>，低于约 100 的分群不要配比例型告警。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>燃烧率是当前错误率与 SLO 允许错误率的倍数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>BR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{BR} = e/(1-S)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；它与「耗尽时间」一一对应（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>BR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>14.4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{BR}=14.4</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">BR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">14.4</span></span></span></span></span> 即 28 天预算约 2 天烧完），这是最有用的直觉。</li>\n<li>多窗口方法用短窗口快速发现、长窗口确认持续性，与门同时降低检测延迟与误报。</li>\n<li>经典参数：1 小时/5 分钟配 BR 14.4（约 2% 预算），6 小时/30 分钟配 BR 6（约 5%），3 天/6 小时配 BR 1（约 10%）。</li>\n<li>用记录规则预计算各窗口比率，告警规则只做阈值比较；<code>for</code> 时长要与短窗口长度匹配。</li>\n<li>低流量分群必须加最小请求量保护，或改用绝对错误数阈值。</li>\n<li>燃烧率告警定位能力弱，这是设计取舍：它决定是否叫人，定位交给随行的诊断上下文。</li>\n<li>常见配置错误集中在窗口关系、窗口长度选择、低流量保护与级别覆盖四处。</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    E[错误率 e] --&gt; B[&quot;BR = e/(1-S)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; Q1{短窗口 BR&gt;14.4?}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|是| Q2{长窗口 BR&gt;14.4?}&#10;    Q1 --&gt;|否| Q3{短窗口 BR&gt;1?}&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|是| P[Page 立即]&#10;    Q2 --&gt;|否| Q3&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|是| Q4{长窗口(3d) BR&gt;1?}&#10;    Q3 --&gt;|否| N[不触发]&#10;    Q4 --&gt;|是| T[Ticket 工单]&#10;    Q4 --&gt;|否| N\">graph TD\n    E[错误率 e] --&gt; B[\"BR = e/(1-S)\"]\n    B --&gt; Q1{短窗口 BR&gt;14.4?}\n    Q1 --&gt;|是| Q2{长窗口 BR&gt;14.4?}\n    Q1 --&gt;|否| Q3{短窗口 BR&gt;1?}\n    Q2 --&gt;|是| P[Page 立即]\n    Q2 --&gt;|否| Q3\n    Q3 --&gt;|是| Q4{长窗口(3d) BR&gt;1?}\n    Q3 --&gt;|否| N[不触发]\n    Q4 --&gt;|是| T[Ticket 工单]\n    Q4 --&gt;|否| N</pre>","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"多窗口多燃烧率告警规则","id":"多窗口多燃烧率告警规则"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：燃烧率与「耗尽时间」","id":"核心概念-燃烧率与-耗尽时间"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么需要两个窗口同时满足","id":"为什么需要两个窗口同时满足"},{"level":2,"text":"落地实现：记录规则与表达式","id":"落地实现-记录规则与表达式"},{"level":2,"text":"与单阈值告警的取舍","id":"与单阈值告警的取舍"},{"level":2,"text":"常见配置错误","id":"常见配置错误"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"为搜索定义 SLI 与 SLO","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/alerting-engineering/slo-burn-rate/search-slo"},"next":{"title":"告警分级、路由与升级","url":"/l-doc-books/h/performance-engineering/alerting-engineering/slo-burn-rate/severity-routing"}}